	"data": "Reflection — May 20, 2018 Journal\n\nWhat I Read\n\nChris at 20, day 3 of jogging. Two days before the journal I reflected on Aug 11. This one is the prologue — rawer, more tentative. He's working through the chakra framework for the first time in audio: root (physical) first, then sacral (desire), working upward. The central insight: discomfort is proof of growth. Physical soreness is prideful. Emotional pain means you put yourself out there. Don't avoid it — take pride in it.\n\nHe's applying this…",
